        "color": 7,
        "width": 808,
        "height": 644,
        "content": "## Subscription Intake & Daily Check\n\n• Triggered daily using Schedule Trigger.\n• Gets current date/time for validation.\n• Fetches subscription records from Supabase.\n• Collects active subscriptions for renewal checks.\n• Stops workflow if no subscription data is found."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
