    {
      "id": "92ff2f04-ffc3-41a1-88a3-4e44dff38e33",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1680,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 784,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## Expiry Validation & Reminder\n\n• Validates only active subscriptions.\n• Checks if the subscription expires within the next 3 days.\n• Sends renewal reminder email for expiring subscriptions.\n• Conditions:\n   - status = active\n   - end_date >= current date\n   - end_date <= current date + 3 days\n• Subscriptions not meeting these conditions are ignored."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a00fc918-d7fd-4015-b15a-c7c519f52b16",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2496,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 672,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## Payment Processing & Status Check\n\n• Sends subscription payment details to the payment API.\n• Adds a helper field `hasId` to indicate if payment response exists.\n• Checks payment status:\n   - If ID exists → payment successful\n   - If ID missing → payment failed email sent"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b52ed987-e4b9-43f1-845f-a918eb4f6a5b",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3200,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 784,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## Subscription Update & Notifications\n\n• On success: status set to active, dates updated, confirmation email sent.\n• On failure: payment failure email sent, customer prompted to update payment method.\n• Ensures users are notified for both outcomes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "629585a0-1ae3-4bab-8857-7a3a2f6bd782",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -128,
        -32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 928,
        "height": 928,
        "content": "## Automated Subscription Management Workflow\n\n### Overview:\nThis workflow automates the daily checking of customer subscriptions, validating active subscriptions, sending renewal reminders, processing payments, updating subscription statuses, and sending notifications.\n\n## How it Works:\n\n• This workflow automatically checks customer subscriptions every day.\n• It fetches subscription records from Supabase and validates only active subscriptions.\n• It checks whether each subscription is expiring within the next 3 days.\n• If the subscription is near expiry, the workflow sends a renewal reminder email to the customer.\n• The workflow then sends subscription and customer payment details to the payment processing API.\n• Based on the payment response, the workflow decides whether the payment was successful or failed.\n• If payment is successful, the subscription record is updated in Supabase with new dates and active status.\n• A confirmation email is sent after successful renewal.\n• If payment fails, the workflow sends a payment failure email asking the user to update payment details.\n\n### Setup Steps:\n\n1. Create a Schedule Trigger to run the workflow daily.\n2. Add a DateTime node to get the current execution date.\n3. Configure Supabase credentials and fetch records from the subscriptions table.\n4. Add an IF node to check only active subscriptions.\n5. Add another IF node to validate subscriptions expiring within 3 days.\n6. Configure Gmail node to send renewal reminder emails.\n7. Configure HTTP Request node to send payment details to Stripe/PayPal/payment API.\n8. Add Code node to check whether payment response contains an ID.\n9. Add IF node to separate successful and failed payment branches.\n10. On success, update Supabase subscription status and renewal dates.\n11. Send confirmation email to the customer.\n12. On failure, send payment failure email to the customer."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
